&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pkprab&quot; data-start=&quot;1360&quot; data-end=&quot;1485&quot;&gt;Own the reading experience -- the in-house book renderer and audio-text sync (narration aligned to word-level highlighting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dho9q1&quot; data-start=&quot;1486&quot; data-end=&quot;1561&quot;&gt;Own offline reading, in-app purchases, and the App Store release pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1p804qb&quot; data-start=&quot;1562&quot; data-end=&quot;1615&quot;&gt;Drive the app&#39;s performance, stability, and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pjs7gh&quot; data-start=&quot;1616&quot; data-end=&quot;1703&quot;&gt;Partner with Epic&#39;s Android engineer and the backend and web teams on shared features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dddekr&quot; data-start=&quot;1704&quot; data-end=&quot;1818&quot;&gt;Grow into a cross-platform mobile engineer over time, ramping into Android/Kotlin to contribute across both apps&lt;/li&gt;
