&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;nbk8dt&quot; data-start=&quot;1820&quot; data-end=&quot;1845&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;8b3p4d&quot; data-start=&quot;1847&quot; data-end=&quot;1874&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1876&quot; data-end=&quot;2380&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1k5lfjz&quot; data-start=&quot;1876&quot; data-end=&quot;1941&quot;&gt;5+ years building and shipping native iOS apps to the App Store&lt;/li&gt;
