&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ip6n53&quot; data-start=&quot;2034&quot; data-end=&quot;2147&quot;&gt;Proven depth in custom UI/text rendering and/or real-time media-audio synchronization (not only stock controls)&lt;/li&gt;
