&lt;p data-start=&quot;286&quot; data-end=&quot;848&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;286&quot; data-end=&quot;304&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;286&quot; data-end=&quot;848&quot;&gt;Epic is the leading digital reading platform for kids, used by millions of children, families, and educators around the world. With a vast library of high-quality books and learning resources, we empower students to explore their interests, build literacy skills, and develop a lifelong love of reading. As we look to the future, Epic is reimagining what reading can be—more personalized, more interactive, and more accessible than ever before. We’re combining technology, storytelling, and education to shape the next generation of readers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;850&quot; data-end=&quot;1213&quot;&gt;The TikTok Livestream Host will represent Epic! on TikTok Live by presenting products, engaging directly with viewers, and creating an energetic, authentic on-screen experience that drives purchases. This is a&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;contract position&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;requiring&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;approximately 10–15 hours per week,&amp;nbsp;with in-person livestreaming required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1024&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1024&quot; data-end=&quot;1044&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;1. Livestream Hosting &amp;amp; On-Screen Engagement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1115&quot; data-end=&quot;1316&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1115&quot; data-end=&quot;1169&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1117&quot; data-end=&quot;1169&quot;&gt;Host TikTok live streams showcasing Epic! products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1237&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1172&quot; data-end=&quot;1237&quot;&gt;Maintain a positive, engaging, and energetic on-screen presence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1238&quot; data-end=&quot;1316&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1240&quot; data-end=&quot;1316&quot;&gt;Interact with viewers in real time by responding to comments and questions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
