&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1434&quot; data-end=&quot;1515&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1436&quot; data-end=&quot;1515&quot;&gt;Encourage purchases through effective storytelling and product demonstrations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
